# Local dev server log, written by `npm run start` in a session.
.srv.log

# Test-run output, written by `node tests/run.mjs` in a session. Same reason as
# the line above: it is a record of one run on one machine, it is thousands of
# lines long, and a `git add -A` sweeps it into the commit if it is not named
# here — which has happened.
.suite.log

# Build output, written by `npm run build` in a session. Same reason again.
.build.log
